{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421310/extras/steam_description_panel_1.png?t=1745976154\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Have you ever thought of robbing a museum in roller skates?!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even if you didn't think about that before, here's your chance to retrieve looted treasures, stolen from their rightful owners during colonization period centuries ago!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421310/extras/invade_new.gif?t=1745976154\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Pick up your roller</strong> <strong>skates!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pay a little visit to museums around the world in this fast-paced heist game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421310/extras/retrieve_new.gif?t=1745976154\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Get those artifacts back!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take looted artifacts back to their original locations! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421310/extras/escape_new.gif?t=1745976154\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Don't be caught!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avoid guards! Make sure you will accomplish the missions assigned to you and repair history!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421310/extras/kenai_steal_retrieve.png?t=1745976154\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3421310?t=1745976154","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.